=== Markdown -> HTML Converter ===
test.md 생성 완료
test.html 변환 완료

--- 생성된 HTML ---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Document</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Hello World</h1>
<h2>Sub Heading</h2>
<p>This is <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> text.</p>
<p>Here is <code>inline code</code> example.</p>
<p>Visit <a href="https://google.com">Google</a> for search.</p>
<blockquote><p>This is a blockquote.</p></blockquote>
<ul>
<li>First item</li>
<li>Second item</li>
<li>Third item</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<pre><code>function hello() {
  return 42;
}
</code></pre>
<h3>Features</h3>
<p>Simple &amp; clean <strong>HTML</strong> output with &lt;special&gt; chars.</p>
</body>
</html>
